            "notes": "Like last season, we start with [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb). \n\nEven though the power has been nerfed, it is still very useful for farming cash AND, more importantly, it synergizes very well with [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) on the third turn.\n\nI usually start with [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), but if I see that the map has long sightlines including enemy heroes with range, then [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) can also be a good option.\n\nThere's not much to say about the first round. Just make sure you keep two beams up and try to collect as much cash as possible.",
