            "notes": "Round Two!\n\nIn most games, you should have enough cash to sell all the starter items except for the Armored Vest to get the [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e).\n\nThis gives you a good base of Weapon Power and Attack Speed. It's important to note that Attack Speed \u200b\u200balso boosts your healing! Therefore, it shouldn't be overlooked.\n\nIf you're really rich, you can also sell the Armored Vest in this round and get some [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) instead.",
