            "notes": "**Round three, this is where the fun begins!**\n\nNormally, this is the time to use [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb). \n\n**BUT** if you feel like you need to heal more because your second support is struggling, you can also use [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) on the third round.\n\nIf you use [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb):\nMake sure you use Cooldown Reduction yourself so you can use [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) more often. I like to use [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for this. \nIf there are no problems with healing, [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) is also a good option to boost the team's DMG even more. Instead of [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) or [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), you can of course also use the classic [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) for more healing power.\n\nIf you use [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4):\nForget about cooldown reduction for yourself for now and focus on weapon power, e.g., [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) and Attack Speed Items.\n\nBy the third round, you'll also realize why [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) synergizes so well with [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb). The effect of Supply Surge spreads to every target the beam is connected to. This means that in Valk, the entire team gets the effect.\n\nMake sure you use Supply Surge in a way that benefits two targets. Almost every hero benefits from it, but I especially prefer to use it to boost heroes who rely on their cooldowns, like Moira, Pharah, Zarya, Kiriko, Mei, etc. \n\nThis can be a little tricky at first, and you should keep an eye on which teammate is currently using a cooldown so you don't activate Supply Surge for nothing.\n\nMoira Orbs/Fade, Pharah Jet, Cassidy's Roll, Zarya's Bubbles, Kiriko's Suzu, Soldier's Helix, etc.\n\nEspecially in stressful situations, reducing the cooldown of the second support or the tank can be very valuable! :)",
