            "notes": "**Round Four!**\n\nFor [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb):\nWe continue to focus on reducing our own cooldown. This not only has the advantage of allowing us to use [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb) more often, but also makes our own movement smoother due to the shorter GA cooldown.\nTypical items I have on my list for this: [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)(also good if you need more survival), [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f), [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)\n\nFor [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4):\n[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) is not only nice for its move speed, but also provides a significant healing boost! Therefore, it's often one of the items I keep in mind for the fourth round.\n\nIf you haven't picked up [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) yet, consider getting it!",
