            "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:53:01.896409+00:00",
            "notes": "**Round Six!**\n\nNormally, you should now have the following items:\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n[Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48)\n[Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124)\n[Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)\n[Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca)\n\nAll of these items together provide a very good mix of Weapon Power, Attack Speed, and cooldown reduction.\n\nIf you really feel like [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) isn't doing much good, for example, because you don't have time to boost or are struggling too much to survive, you can also use a survival item instead of Evoker.\n\n[Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), or [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121).\n\nEspecially if you have chosen [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d) as your third Power instead of [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4), a Survival Item is a good option to make the rezz even safer.",
